Three cluster max reports leave only core weave platinum for AI cluster operations. This is AI Chips &amp; Data Centres, episode three. Core Weave says semi-analysis has published cluster max 3.0. Core Weave put that note up on September 23rd, 2026. Dylan Patel, who founded semi-analysis, called Core Weave the benchmark other operators get measured against. Core Weave framed the score as how gpu-cloud clusters are run.

